<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><h1>Paid Access Settings</h1><p>Fees apply to new registrations. An individual price overrides the default; blank uses the default, and zero is free. Disabling paid access makes new registrations free. Inactive sections close new access and hide their catalog; existing confirmations remain available. Product checkout is separate.</p><% if(error){ %><p role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><form method="post" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><% ['courses','webinars','books','consulting'].forEach(kind=>{const value=settings[kind]; %><fieldset><legend><%= kind[0].toUpperCase()+kind.slice(1) %></legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="<%= kind %>_enabled" <%= value.enabled?'checked':'' %>> Paid Access Enabled</label><label>Default Access Fee (INR)<input name="<%= kind %>_fee" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" required value="<%= value.fee %>"></label><label>Currency<input value="INR" readonly></label><label>Button Text<input name="<%= kind %>_button" maxlength="80" required value="<%= value.button_text %>"></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="<%= kind %>_active" <%= value.active?'checked':'' %>> Active</label></fieldset><% }) %><button class="fashion-button">Save Paid Access Settings</button></form></main></body></html>
